     "@sap.visible": "true",
     "@sap.sortable": "false",
     "@sap.filterable": "false",
     "@sap.label": "A conviction will not automatically bar anyone from employment. An individualized assessment will be made based on the job in question and consistent with business necessity. The following question seeks information regarding your past criminal history. Please note the following: A ‘yes’ answer will not automatically disqualify you from employment. However, failure to disclose a reportable offense will be considered a falsification of Company records and will disqualify you from employment, no matter when the falsification is discovered. If you reside in or are applying for a position in the City of Buffalo, NY, Newark, NJ, Philadelphia, PA, San Francisco, CA, Seattle, WA and/or live in the State of California, Connecticut, District of Columbia, Georgia, Hawaii, Iowa, Illinois, Maryland, Massachusetts, Michigan, Minnesota, Nebraska, Nevada, New York, Ohio, Pennsylvania, Rhode Island, refer to the instructions below specific to your State and/or city before answering the criminal conviction question. Thoroughly read and carefully follow the applicable instructions available HERE before answering the below criminal history question(s). NOTE: Every effort has been made to ensure the accuracy of this list, however, it is possible that interpretations and/or updates may have occurred, which are not reflected herein. DO NOT IDENTIFY a record of adult or juvenile arrest, detention or conviction that has been sealed, expunged, annulled, erased, pardoned or statutorily eradicated, set aside or otherwise dismissed by court order. By inputting anything into the following field you will indicate that you understand these INSTRUCTIONS FOR ANSWERING THE CRIMINAL CONVICTION QUESTION and agree that your electronic signature is legally binding, and has the same validity and meaning as your handwritten signature on a paper document."
